; EA_RUNNER v3 — IS OPTIMIZE SET v2 (FIXED: non-overlapping Fast/Slow, complete algo)
; StrategySignal_v3: MACD+RSI+EMA, both filters ON at defaults.
;
; FIX vs v1: previous set had Fast range up to 24 and Slow range from 18 → many
; combos with Fast>=Slow returned INIT_FAILED (ValidateParams rejects), which made
; the GENETIC optimizer abort after ~6 passes. Now Fast<=18 and Slow>=24 → every
; combo is valid, zero OnInit failures. Use Optimization=1 (slow COMPLETE) for full
; coverage; grid is small enough (1,500 combos) to brute-force with Model 2.
;
; Ranges: Fast||6||3||18||Y   = 6,9,12,15,18      (5)
;         Slow||24||6||48||Y  = 24,30,36,42,48    (5)
;         Signal||5||2||13||Y = 5,7,9,11,13       (5)
;         SL||150||100||450||Y= 150,250,350,450   (4)
;         TP||200||200||600||Y= 200,400,600       (3)
; Total: 5×5×5×4×3 = 1,500 combos, all valid.

InpAllowLiveOrders=true||0||0||0||N
InpUseZeroLineFilter=false||0||0||0||N
InpMinCrossStrength=0.0||0||0||0||N
InpCountBars=0||0||0||0||N
InpVerboseLogging=false||0||0||0||N
InpHoldBars=0||0||0||0||N
InpStopLossPoints=300||150||100||450||Y
InpTakeProfitPoints=400||200||200||600||Y
InpMacdFast=12||6||3||18||Y
InpMacdSlow=26||24||6||48||Y
InpMacdSignal=9||5||2||13||Y
InpRsiPeriod=14||0||0||0||N
InpUseRsiFilter=true||0||0||0||N
InpRsiOverbought=70.0||0||0||0||N
InpRsiOversold=30.0||0||0||0||N
InpEmaPeriod=50||0||0||0||N
InpUseEmaFilter=true||0||0||0||N
